OL,3,GNEWSALord Mayor favourite withdraws
OL,4,Aafter ex-boss probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe expected new Lord Mayor of the City
OL,7,Fof London has withdrawn after being
OL,8,Fmade aware that criminal proceedings
OL,9,Fhad been launched against someone
OL,10,F"closely connected" to a previous
OL,11,Femployer.
OL,13,FAlderman Timothy Hailes, who was named
OL,14,Fby the Court of Aldermen as their
OL,15,Fpreferred candidate for 2026/2027
OL,16,Fannounced his decision at a recent
OL,17,Fmeeting.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
