OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALord Mayor favourite withdraws
OL,4,Aafter ex-boss probe
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement sent to all City of
OL,7,FLondon Corporation members, Alderman
OL,8,FHailes said he he personally was not
OL,9,Funder investigation, but he wanted to
OL,10,Fensure the mayoralty was not brought
OL,11,Finto disrepute.
OL,13,FAlderman Hailes added that he hoped to
OL,14,Fbe considered for the Mayoralty at a
OL,15,Flater date "when circumstances permit
OL,16,Fit".
